# RTMX MCP — agent session inside Cursor (not shell cat/list)
# Config lives in README; this GIF shows tools used by the agent.
# Record only via: make gifs  (Docker; no host paths)
# Output: docs/assets/rtmx-mcp-setup.gif

Output docs/assets/rtmx-mcp-setup.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1000
Set Height 620
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set Padding 16
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Set CursorBlink false

# Simulated Cursor agent invoking MCP tools over stdio
Type "agent-mcp-session"
Enter
Sleep 8s
